Sociale Zaken, Volksgezondheid en Leefmilieu</publisher-name></element-citation></ref><ref id="b10-ijerph-05-00243"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="webpage"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>VIG</collab></person-group><comment>De voedingsdriehoek: een praktische voedingsgids 2004 Available from <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.vig.be/content/pdf/VD_praktischegids.pdf">http://www.vig.be/content/pdf/VD_praktischegids.pdf</ext-link>.</comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="b11-ijerph-05-00243"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>US Department of Agriculture</collab></person-group><source>Center for Nutrition Policy and Promotion</source><publisher-name>MyPyramide</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Washington, DC</publisher-loc><year>2007</year></element-citation></ref><ref id="b12-ijerph-05-00243"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fraser</surname><given-names>GE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diet and coronary heart disease: beyond dietary fats and low-density-lipoprotein cholesterol</article-title><source>Am. J. Clin. Nutr.</source><year>1994</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>1117S</fpage><lpage>1123S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8172111</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b13-ijerph-05-00243"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huybrechts</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>De Henauw</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Energy and nutrient intakes by pre-school children in Flanders-Belgium</article-title><source>Br. J. Nutr.</source><year>2007</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>600</fpage><lpage>610</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17445352</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b14-ijerph-05